  "limitations": [
    "The layout depicts the apron in the Street View image published in May 2012. Camera height, three-dimensional airframe profiles and markings outside the camera view are estimated.",
    "The common shared painted-metal graph supplies the airframes. The yellow DHL paint and red, blue and grey patterns distinguish the visible liveries. Exact aircraft makes and model numbers remain unresolved.",
    "The 2003 two-aircraft recipe remains in the source bundle. The 2022 photographs and current overhead imagery show later changes.",
    "The 2012 panorama fixes the west-southwest camera and the signed aircraft poses. The reconstruction is scaled uniformly to 89% around that camera and clears the nearest mapped visitor path by 2.7706 m. A date-specific ground grade seats the deck at all tested detail levels. The historical grade and the original platform dimensions are estimates."
